                "text": "I ran for Congress to keep our communities healthy and safe. The Republican continuing resolution fails that test. It does nothing to address the looming healthcare crisis or to stop Trump from illegally withholding critical funds from programs he doesn\u2019t like. I won\u2019t support a harmful, partisan bill that betrays the people I serve. Simple as that.",
