                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Two weeks ago, on October 1 at 12:01 am, the Republican majority shut down the government, because they decided they\u2019d rather do that than come to the table to keep your healthcare costs from skyrocketing. https://t.co/2jVREA4d2p",
