                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "With the Republican Shutdown in its third week, I\u2019m here in the 10th fighting for better healthcare by\u2026\n\ud83c\udfe5 Breaking ground on an hospital expansion \n\ud83e\ude77 Walking for a cure\n\ud83d\udcc1 Getting folks resources at our mobile office hours https://t.co/a0e39RaTZc",
