                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Nancy Pelosi is an icon. From delivering healthcare for tens of millions to serving her constituents first, I will always be grateful I get to serve with her. As this administration attacks me, I have felt for myself just how fiercely she stands up. Thank you, Madam Speaker. https://t.co/8gLr9REbic",
