                "quoted_status_profile_username": "JakeSherman",
                "reply_count": 15,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans won\u2019t, so Americans are counting on Democrats to keep fighting for them. We can\u2019t roll over for just the promise of an ACA vote in the Senate. Premiums are going to spike and lives are on the line. I won\u2019t support a \u201cdeal\u201d that doesn\u2019t even try to protect healthcare.",
