                "text": "Leaving D.C. right now after coming down today to stand strong, vote no, and keep fighting for you, NJ-10. I came straight from surgery this morning to make sure Republicans heard us loud and clear: affordable healthcare matters! The fight continues. https://t.co/EeZW19g7sv",
